@startuml Studio_Booking_Public_Seq

title Sequence Diagram - Proses Booking Studio (Public)

actor User
participant "Web App" as App
participant System
database Database

User -> App: Buka halaman katalog studio
App -> Database: Query daftar studio available
Database --> App: Return studio list
App --> User: Tampilkan katalog studio

User -> App: Pilih studio
App -> Database: Query detail studio + price
Database --> App: Return studio details
App --> User: Tampilkan detail studio

User -> App: Isi form booking (tanggal, jam)
App -> System: Check availability (tanggal/jam)
System -> Database: Query existing bookings
Database --> System: Return bookings
System -> System: Check conflict
System --> App: Tersedia atau tidak

alt Jam tersedia
  App --> User: Tampilkan total harga
else Jam tidak tersedia
  App --> User: Show error + suggest alternative
end

User -> App: Klik "Checkout"
User -> App: Isi data penyewa + payment method
App --> User: Show ringkasan order

User -> App: Klik "Confirm & Pay"
App -> System: Process payment
System -> System: Validate payment method
System --> App: Payment success/fail

alt Payment berhasil
  System -> Database: Create booking record
  System -> Database: Update studio availability
  System -> App: Send confirmation email
  App --> User: Show confirmation code
else Payment gagal
  App --> User: Show error message
end

@enduml
